---
// src/pages/layanan-seragam.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Layanan Jahit & Seragam Kustom | Batik Smile Nusantara">
  <div class="min-h-screen py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#FAF7F2] text-[#161616]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-[#9E4719] font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-2 block">
          Private Atelier & Tailoring
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-normal text-[#161616]">
          Solusi Seragam Batik & Jahitan Kustom
        </h1>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-[#161616]/75 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
          Melayani pembuatan seragam instansi pemerintah, BUMN, rumah sakit, korporat swasta, keluarga, hingga jahit satuan <strong>tanpa minimal order</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Core Advantages -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#161616]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl block">✨</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-[#9E4719]">Tanpa Min. Order</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#161616]/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Mulai dari 1 potong baju hingga ratusan set seragam lengkap siap kami layani dengan standar mutu butik yang sama.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#161616]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl block">✂️</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-[#9E4719]">Jahitan Presisi</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#161616]/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Didukung penjahit ahli berpengalaman dengan cutting motif simetris rapi dan lapisan furing hero adem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#161616]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl block">⏱️</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-[#9E4719]">Tepat Waktu</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#161616]/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Manajemen produksi terstruktur menjamin pesanan seragam Anda selesai tepat waktu sesuai jadwal acara.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#161616]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl block">🧵</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-[#9E4719]">Katalog Lengkap</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#161616]/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Pilihan bahan luas: Katun Primisima, Tenun Dobby, Lurik Etnik, Tenun Troso Jepara, Songket, hingga Sutra mewah.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Categories of Custom Tailoring -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-[#141414] text-[#FAF7F2] mb-16 shadow-2xl space-y-8">
        <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto">
          <span class="text-[#C5A059] text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold block mb-2">
            Portofolio Pelayanan
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white">
            Kategori Pesanan yang Kami Layani
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#C5A059]">1. Seragam Kantor & Instansi</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Pakaian kerja harian, batik dinas instansi, seragam BUMN, dan seragam rumah sakit. Telah dipercaya oleh <strong>RS Bhayangkara Semarang</strong>, <strong>RSUD dr. Adhyatma Semarang</strong>, dan berbagai korporasi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#C5A059]">2. Acara Keluarga & Momen Spesial</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Sarimbit keluarga inti, seragam pernikahan (kondangan), lamaran, tunangan, seragam wisuda, dan panitia resepsi dengan ukuran pas di badan.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#C5A059]">3. Komunitas & Akademik</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Seragam wisuda kampus, sekolah, paguyuban, serta seragam perkumpulan etnik Nusantara.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#C5A059]">4. Jahit Kustom Satuan</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Kemeja pria slimfit/regular lapis furing, blus wanita, tunik, gamis, outer cape, kebaya encim modern, hingga pola khusus pesanan Anda.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- WhatsApp Direct Consultation CTA -->
      <div class="text-center p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-[#161616]/10 shadow-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#161616] mb-3">
          Konsultasikan Seragam Anda Bersama Kami
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#161616]/70 mb-6 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Diskusikan kebutuhan corak, pemilihan bahan kain, estimasi budget, dan panduan ukuran bersama tim konsultan seragam Batik Smile Semarang.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/6281390888809?text=Halo%20Batik%20Smile,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pemesanan%20seragam%20batik%20kustom" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1EBE5D] text-white font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold rounded-full shadow-xl transition-all gap-2"
        >
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Konsultasi WhatsApp (081-390-8888-09)</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
